 "url": "https://pacific-ridge.example.com/team"}]}}', '6b70a3aa0e7b52348245a923d31bd2ec', '1990-07-18', 'male', 'Fresno, California', 'San Diego, California', 'Investigations supervisor · Pacific Ridge Police Department', 'Coordinates incident review, evidence handovers and field documentation for the investigations team. Twelve years of experience in patrol and investigative support, with a focus on clear records, chain of custody and communication between shifts.', '+1 619 555 0101', 'https://pacific-ridge.example.com', '[{"label": "Professional profile", "url": "https://pacific-ridge.example.com/team/alex-rivera"}, {"label": "Work group", "url": "https://pacific-ridge.example.com/team"}]', '2e17e87026405911b419935a3dbabf23', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'empty', NULL, FALSE, NULL, '2026-11-04 14:14:56');
