m"}]}}', '002698d65b515f23a6b78f9ac69767a8', '1992-02-11', 'female', 'Oakland, California', 'San Diego, California', 'Crime scene investigator · Pacific Ridge Police Department', 'Documents incident scenes, prepares photographic records and coordinates evidence collection with investigators. Specializes in scene organization, traceable observations and consistent handovers between field and laboratory teams.', '+1 619 555 0102', 'https://pacific-ridge.example.com', '[{"label": "Professional profile", "url": "https://pacific-ridge.example.com/team/maya-johnson"}, {"label": "Work group", "url": "https://pacific-ridge.example.com/team"}]', '927fee29da335045b1cf6699359d4711', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'empty', NULL, FALSE, NULL, '2026-11-04 14:14:56');
