.example.com/team"}]}}', '9467affefe045ed8ae5c4d4bb7c5ac23', '1993-09-16', 'male', 'Fresno, California', 'Sacramento, California', 'Registered nurse, inpatient care · California Valley Medical Center', 'Provides bedside nursing support and keeps patient observations and shift notes up to date. Works with the unit coordinator to prepare care handovers, organize supplies and document completed tasks for the next team.', '+1 916 555 0105', 'https://california-valley.example.com', '[{"label": "Professional profile", "url": "https://california-valley.example.com/team/mateo-rios"}, {"label": "Work group", "url": "https://california-valley.example.com/team"}]', '771cf8dbd0e95b14ab85e2059493492c', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'empty', NULL, FALSE, NULL, '2026-11-04 14:14:57');
