.example.com/team"}]}}', '63297a1bbc7f52df9b76cf3c33739bb7', '1991-12-03', 'female', 'Portland, Oregon', 'Sacramento, California', 'Registered nurse and follow-up coordinator · California Valley Medical Center', 'Coordinates patient follow-up, discharge documentation and communication with families and the care team. Focuses on clear instructions, complete records and continuity between inpatient care and scheduled reviews.', '+1 916 555 0106', 'https://california-valley.example.com', '[{"label": "Professional profile", "url": "https://california-valley.example.com/team/sarah-chen"}, {"label": "Work group", "url": "https://california-valley.example.com/team"}]', '46bef77fd9c7553d964a8d05bab101ac', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'empty', NULL, FALSE, NULL, '2026-11-04 14:14:57');
