rl": "https://sonoran-neurological.example.com/team/noah-brooks"}, {"label": "Grupo de trabajo", "url": "https://sonoran-neurological.example.com/team"}]}}', 'e25476251c5053798e4cf7d8221074ee', '1987-06-08', 'male', 'Phoenix, Arizona', 'Tucson, Arizona', 'Occupational therapist and care coordinator · Sonoran Neurological Institute', 'Coordinates daily-living support and follow-up plans with the rehabilitation team. Helps organize routines, personal reminders and records of familiar objects so that patients and their authorized care network can review useful context together.', '+1 520 555 0107', 'https://sonoran-neurological.example.com', '[{"label": "Professional profile", "url": "https://sonoran-neurological.example.com/team/noah-brooks"}, {"label": "Work group", "url": "https://sonoran-neurological.example.com/team"}]', '84550d9db4ad5dd599cfbf09b69877cf', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'empty', NULL, FALSE, NULL, '2026-11-04 14:14:57');
